  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Science and Mathematics in Primary Education in Timor-Le</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to improve the Mathematics and Science education at the basic level (first and second Cycles) in order to enable the educational system and scientific community of Timor-Leste to fulfil its goal. In which that aims in providing lifelong opportunities and enabling Timorese people to reach their full potential. In order to achieve this objective, design thinking evidence-based educational best practices from the region will be shared for the Mathematics and Science basic (first and second Cycles) education through the delivery of four major components.</narrative>
  </description>
